---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/submission-wizard.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Submit an MCP server — FreeMCP" description="Prepare and preview your open-source MCP server submission for manual review.">
<section class="container submit-wizard">
  <h1>Submit an MCP server</h1>
  <p class="wizard-lede">Build a listing, preview it, then open a public GitHub issue for maintainer review.</p>
  <div class="wizard-panel">
    <ol class="wizard-steps" aria-label="Submission progress">
      <li aria-current="step">Repository</li><li>Listing details</li><li>Preview</li><li>Submit for review</li>
    </ol>
    <noscript><p>The editor and preview use JavaScript. <a href="https://github.com/strbbrn/freemcp-registry/issues/new?template=submit-server.md">Submit directly on GitHub</a>.</p></noscript>
    <form id="submit-server" novalidate hidden>
      <section data-step="0" aria-labelledby="step-repository">
        <h2 id="step-repository" tabindex="-1">Repository</h2>
        <label>GitHub repository URL<input type="url" name="repository" autocomplete="url" placeholder="https://github.com/owner/repository" /></label>
        <div class="wizard-disclosure">
          <label>Git branch <span>Optional. Defaults to the repository’s default branch.</span><input name="branch" maxlength="200" /></label>
          <div class="wizard-actions"><button type="button" id="analyze-repo">Analyze GitHub repository</button><button type="button" id="apply-analysis" hidden>Fill untouched fields</button></div>
          <p id="analyze-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <a id="analysis-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>View source on GitHub</a>
        </div>
        <details class="wizard-disclosure">
          <summary>Upload or paste JSON</summary>
          <p>Use a freemcp.json v1 manifest or listing JSON. Applying it replaces the current listing.</p>
          <label>Upload JSON file<input type="file" id="import-file" accept=".json,application/json" /></label>
          <label>Paste JSON<textarea id="import-json" rows="5" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label>
          <button type="button" id="apply-import">Apply JSON import</button>
        </details>
        <button type="button" data-next class="wizard-primary">Continue to listing details</button>
      </section>
      <section data-step="1" aria-labelledby="step-details" hidden>
        <h2 id="step-details" tabindex="-1">Listing details</h2>
        <div class="wizard-actions">
          <button type="button" data-mode="structured" aria-pressed="true">Structured editor</button>
          <button type="button" data-mode="json" aria-pressed="false">Advanced JSON</button>
          <button type="button" data-download="json">Download JSON</button>
        </div>
        <div id="structured-fields"></div>
        <div id="advanced-fields" hidden>
          <label>Listing JSON<textarea id="listing-json" rows="16" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label>
          <p>Valid JSON becomes the structured draft when you switch back. Use placeholders for environment variables and credentials.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wizard-actions"><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next class="wizard-primary">Preview listing</button></div>
      </section>
      <section data-step="2" aria-labelledby="step-preview" hidden>
        <h2 id="step-preview" tabindex="-1">Preview</h2>
        <div class="wizard-actions">
          <button type="button" data-frame="desktop" aria-pressed="true">Desktop preview</button>
          <button type="button" data-frame="mobile" aria-pressed="false">Mobile preview</button>
          <button type="button" id="check-duplicates">Check published registry for duplicates</button>
        </div>
        <p id="duplicate-status" role="status">Optional check sends the repository, implementation key and endpoint URLs to FreeMCP.</p>
        <div class="wizard-preview-viewport"><iframe id="listing-preview" title="Unpublished submission preview" sandbox="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></iframe></div>
        <div class="wizard-actions"><button type="button" data-back>Back to listing details</button><button type="button" data-next class="wizard-primary">Continue to submission</button></div>
      </section>
      <section data-step="3" aria-labelledby="step-submit" hidden>
        <h2 id="step-submit" tabindex="-1">Submit for review</h2>
        <p>GitHub may require sign-in. The issue will be public after you submit it there. Maintainers review every listing before publication.</p>
        <label class="wizard-check"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" />I have permission to submit this project and have removed all credentials and secrets.</label>
        <p id="handoff-note" role="status"></p>
        <div class="wizard-actions">
          <button type="button" id="copy-title">Copy issue title</button>
          <button type="button" id="copy-body">Copy complete issue body</button>
          <button type="button" data-download="markdown">Download issue Markdown</button>
          <button type="button" data-download="json">Download JSON</button>
        </div>
        <label id="manual-copy" hidden>Copy this text manually<textarea readonly rows="6"></textarea></label>
        <div class="wizard-actions"><button type="button" data-back>Back to preview</button><button type="submit" class="wizard-primary">Review submission on GitHub</button></div>
      </section>
      <div class="wizard-findings" id="wizard-errors" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>
      <div class="wizard-findings" id="wizard-warnings" hidden></div>
    </form>
  </div>
  <p class="wizard-help"><a href="https://github.com/strbbrn/freemcp-registry/blob/main/docs/SUBMISSION_SCHEMA.md">Submission JSON and manifest documentation</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  import { initSubmissionWizard } from '../scripts/submission-wizard.mjs';
  initSubmissionWizard(document.querySelector('#submit-server'));
</script>
